  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">iRAP Research and evaluation of road projects in meeting the Global Road Safety Performance Target 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to evaluate progress towards achieving UN Global Road Safety Performance Target 3: that by 2030, all new roads achieve technical standards for all road users should take into account road safety, or meet a three-star rating or better.</narrative>
  </description>
